def event_review_done_subscription_stop: "- The subscription used by teams reached the stop threshold set by \($user): no team opens or reopens until its window resets. You continue running. Tell the user once in three sentences: percent reached, reset date and time, and what waits meanwhile. End with a closed question about raising the threshold, yes or no, and your recommendation. Script output, quoted:\n    | \(.text | gsub("\n"; " "))";
